<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Indorama bonus issue approved.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Indorama bonus issue approved.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian polyester and resin producer PT Indorama Synthetics said on Tuesday shareholders had approved a four-for-five bonus issue.</p>
<p>Company spokesman V.S. Baldwa said shareholders also approved a move to split the nominal value of each share to 500 rupiah from 1,000 rupiah.</p>
<p>The company said the total number of shares will rise to 654.352 million shares from 181.764 million after the stock split and bonus issue.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
